  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Standalone solar power irrigation systems for women farmers cooperatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Engineering Services aims to support small scale women farmers to increase their production by ensuring year-round production through mobilization of the water resources and its efficient use through smart solar drip irrigation systems. GES intends to increase market access to small scale producers through its Bio-Raaga (the market of the bio) application (an application already available) to remove middlemen between the farm and the plate and therefore reduce the cost of produce to the customer and increase the revenues of the women producers. Here are the links to Bio-Raaga.</narrative>
  </description>
